<title>USA: Response Oncology names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Response Oncology names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Response Oncology Inc said Monday it has appointed Mary Clements as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Clements was chief operating officer of the company's practice management division.</p>
<p>The company was not available for comment.</p>
<p>Response Oncology is a comprehensive cancer management, owning and operating a network of advanced-cancer treatment centers and conducting clinical cancer research on behalf of pharmaceutical manufacturers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
